$MDESC::Type = "DELTA FORCE";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Location: <f0>  " @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear and dark" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Two Minutes to Midnight" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Description:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have both been conducting covert night ops & raids in hopes of catching each other with their guard down. The dense black night severely limits visibility within and around the ravine that spans the two opposing bases." @
"\nTake special note that visibility will be very poor; setting up, protecting and maintaining the base sensor network will drastically improve your chances of survival. Advance recon and demolition teams protected by air support is highly recommended " @
"\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Each team must grab the other's flag and bring it back to their base to capture it for <f1>1 point<f4>. The first team to reach <f1>4 points<f4> will rule Damnnation Alley !!!" @

"\n\n<f0>--- For use with the <f1>DELTA FORCE TRIBES<f0> modification. ---" @
"\n<f1>Map Notes:<f0> DF_DamnnationAlley_v0.3  12/10/00.  Redesigned by:<f1> Thrax-THC- ODFC" @
"\n<f1>http://planetstarsiege.com/deltaforce/            <f0>email: <f1>thrax@whoever.com" @
"\n\n<f0>Original Terrain and Layout By:<f1> |MX3| DOX";





